{"id":"bce4e5bfeb4a50a7","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-internal-group-and-torsor.md","title":"Definition — 拓扑斯中的群对象与 torsor","display":"Definition — 拓扑斯中的群对象与 torsor","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-internal-group-and-torsor","aliases":["14-df-internal-group-and-torsor"],"display":"Definition — 拓扑斯中的群对象与 torsor","source_ref":"V.6, group objects and generalized elements, pp.237–238; VIII.2, Definition 6, pp.426–427; internal-group generalization","source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。","verification_status":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked","depends_on":["[[14-df-elementary-topos]]","[[14-df-isomorphism]]","[[14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-internal-group-and-torsor"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-internal-group-and-torsor</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — 拓扑斯中的群对象与 torsor"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"V.6, group objects and generalized elements, pp.237–238; VIII.2, Definition 6, pp.426–427; internal-group generalization"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" href=\"?note=4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" title=\"14-df-elementary-topos\">14-df-elementary-topos</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d5f547b903550705\" href=\"?note=d5f547b903550705\" title=\"14-df-isomorphism\">14-df-isomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8e7f6de1ab6fc49f\" href=\"?note=8e7f6de1ab6fc49f\" title=\"14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism\">14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 为初等拓扑斯。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G,T\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\">\\(G,T\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m:G\\times G\\to G\">\\(m:G\\times G\\to G\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e:1\\to G\">\\(e:1\\to G\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota:G\\to G\">\\(\\iota:G\\to G\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho:G\\times T\\to T\">\\(\\rho:G\\times T\\to T\\)</span> 为候选结构。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g,h,k:A\\to G\">\\(g,h,k:A\\to G\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t:A\\to T\">\\(t:A\\to T\\)</span> 是广义元素；以下 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"gh=m\\langle g,h\\rangle\">\\(gh=m\\langle g,h\\rangle\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g^{-1}=\\iota g\">\\(g^{-1}=\\iota g\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1_A=e!_A\">\\(1_A=e!_A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\\cdot t=\\rho\\langle g,t\\rangle\">\\(g\\cdot t=\\rho\\langle g,t\\rangle\\)</span> 为形式缩写。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IsGroupObject}_{\\mathcal E}(G,m,e,\\iota)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\;\\forall g,h,k:A\\to G\\;\\bigl((gh)k=g(hk)\\land1_Ag=g=g1_A\\land g^{-1}g=1_A=gg^{-1}\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{IsGroupObject}_{\\mathcal E}(G,m,e,\\iota)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\;\\forall g,h,k:A\\to G\\;\\bigl((gh)k=g(hk)\\land1_Ag=g=g1_A\\land g^{-1}g=1_A=gg^{-1}\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{IsTorsor}_{\\mathcal E}(T,\\rho;G,m,e,\\iota)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\\operatorname{IsGroupObject}_{\\mathcal E}(G,m,e,\\iota)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\Bigl(\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall g,h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(A,G)\\ \\forall t\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(A,T)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{10mm}(1_A\\cdot t=t\\land(gh)\\cdot t=g\\cdot(h\\cdot t))\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{IsEpi}(!_T:T\\to1)\\land\\operatorname{IsIso}(\\langle\\rho,\\pi_T\\rangle:G\\times T\\to T\\times T).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{IsTorsor}_{\\mathcal E}(T,\\rho;G,m,e,\\iota)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\\operatorname{IsGroupObject}_{\\mathcal E}(G,m,e,\\iota)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\Bigl(\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall g,h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(A,G)\\ \\forall t\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(A,T)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{10mm}(1_A\\cdot t=t\\land(gh)\\cdot t=g\\cdot(h\\cdot t))\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{IsEpi}(!_T:T\\to1)\\land\\operatorname{IsIso}(\\langle\\rho,\\pi_T\\rangle:G\\times T\\to T\\times T).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源说明：以下来源定位与历史核对经历为所附原稿的记录；本次核对对象为本对话提供的数学笔记。</p>\n<p>群对象的方程对所有广义元素量化，与通常的交换图定义等价：取结构式的定义域为参数对象便恢复每个图。torsor 的两项附加条件分别表示局部非空，以及作用局部自由且传递。它不要求存在全局截面 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\\to T\">\\(1\\to T\\)</span>；把这个条件强加进去会错误地排除非平凡主丛。原书 VIII.2 Definition 6 使用左作用，且其群对象特指由几何态射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathbf{Set}\">\\(\\gamma:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathbf{Set}\\)</span> 的逆像 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma^*(G)\">\\(\\gamma^*(G)\\)</span> 所得的离散常群。本条保留其两条 torsor 条件，并与 V.6 的一般群对象定义结合，推广到任意内部群对象；这一推广为笔记内建定义，不声称是 Definition 6 的逐字范围。</p>\n<p>来源：原稿记录曾读取 Mac Lane–Moerdijk V.6 群对象与广义元素的本地 OCR（印刷237–238页，DjVu124–125），以及 VIII.2 Definition 6（印刷427页，DjVu219）。一般内部群上的 torsor 谓词为上述两处的明确推广；定义由本条形式式完整给出，未作机器验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-elementary-topos","status":"resolved","id":"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-elementary-topos]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"d5f547b903550705","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-isomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism","status":"resolved","id":"8e7f6de1ab6fc49f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"G,T\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)","display":false},{"tex":"m:G\\times G\\to G","display":false},{"tex":"e:1\\to G","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota:G\\to G","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho:G\\times T\\to T","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"g,h,k:A\\to G","display":false},{"tex":"t:A\\to T","display":false},{"tex":"gh=m\\langle g,h\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"g^{-1}=\\iota g","display":false},{"tex":"1_A=e!_A","display":false},{"tex":"g\\cdot t=\\rho\\langle g,t\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IsGroupObject}_{\\mathcal E}(G,m,e,\\iota)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\;\\forall g,h,k:A\\to G\\;\\bigl((gh)k=g(hk)\\land1_Ag=g=g1_A\\land g^{-1}g=1_A=gg^{-1}\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{IsTorsor}_{\\mathcal E}(T,\\rho;G,m,e,\\iota)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\\operatorname{IsGroupObject}_{\\mathcal E}(G,m,e,\\iota)\\\\\n&\\land\\Bigl(\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall g,h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(A,G)\\ \\forall t\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(A,T)\\\\\n&\\hspace{10mm}(1_A\\cdot t=t\\land(gh)\\cdot t=g\\cdot(h\\cdot t))\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\operatorname{IsEpi}(!_T:T\\to1)\\land\\operatorname{IsIso}(\\langle\\rho,\\pi_T\\rangle:G\\times T\\to T\\times T).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"1\\to T","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathbf{Set}","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma^*(G)","display":false}],"bytes":2998,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-301","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-internal-group-and-torsor|df-218 — 拓扑斯中的群对象与 torsor]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-32","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-internal-group-and-torsor]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-157","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-internal-group-and-torsor]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-97","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-df-internal-group-and-torsor]]"},{"id":"d1583fe749649bad","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-303","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-internal-group-and-torsor|df-218 — 拓扑斯中的群对象与 torsor]]"}],"outgoing":["4e6c05c92e3b9bf9","d5f547b903550705","8e7f6de1ab6fc49f"]}